        "sid": "1KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Ahabu adondera Yezebeli ivyo Eliya yakoze vyose, kandi ko yicishije inkota abavugishwa ba Bayali bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yezebeli aca arungika intumwa kuri Eliya kumubwira iti: “Imana zimpane, kandi zize zimpane birushirije cane, ejo umusi niwashika aha uwu ushitse ntarakugira nk’uko wagize abo bavugishwa bandi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya aca aterwa n’ubwoba, aca arahunga kugira ngo akize amagara yiwe. Ageze i Berisheba mu Buyuda, ahasiga wa mukozi wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afata urugendo wenyene aja mu bugaragwa, amara umusi wose agenda. Arahava ashikira igiti c’umurotemu, yicara mu gitutu caco, yisabira gupfa ati: “Ewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ibi biramaze. Ndeka mpfe, sinsumba ba sogokuruza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca aryama musi y’ico giti, arasinzira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko agisinzira, haza umumarayika aramukoma, amubwira ati: “Vyuka urye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikanguye abona umutsima ugeretse ku makara yaka, hamwe n’agakarabo k’amazi. Ararya, anywa n’ayo mazi, aca arasubira ariryamira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa mumarayika aragaruka irya kabiri, aramukoma, amubwira ati: “Vyuka urye, unywe, kuko urugendo ruri imbere yawe ari rurerure cane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikangura, ararya, anywa n’amazi. Ivyo vyokurya bimuha inkomezi amara imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine agenda, gushika ashike ku musozi Horebu, ari wo musozi w’Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashitseyo, yinjira mw’isenga ararayo. Hanyuma Ijambo ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " rimubaza riti: “Eliya, aho uhakora iki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we arishura ati: “Nagiriye ishaka ryinshi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana Mushoboravyose. Ariko Abisirayeli bataye isezerano, basenyagura ibicaniro vyawe, baranduza inkota abavugishwa bawe. Ni jewe jenyene nari nsigaye, none na jewe bariko barandondera ngo banyice.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " amubwira ati: “Sohoka uje guhagarara imbere yanje ku musozi, kuko ngira ndahace.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Eliya ahagaze ngaho, haza umuyaga w’igihuhusi ukomeye cane, usatura imisozi, umenagura n’ibitandara imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ariko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ntiyari muri uwo muyaga. Inyuma yawo haza nyamugigima, ariko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ntiyari muri yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyuma ya nyamugigima haza umuriro, ariko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ntiyari muri uwo muriro. Inyuma y’uwo muriro haza agacere, humvikana ikimeze nk’akajwi gatoya kongorera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya akumvise yiyambura umutamana awitwikira mu maso, aca ariruka ahagarara ku rwinjiriro rw’iryo senga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aca yumva ijwi rimubaza riti: “Eliya, aha uhakora iki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
