        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Eliya ava aho aragenda, abona Elisa mwene Shafati ariko ararimisha inka cumi na zibiri, zifatanijwe n’ingogo ari zibirizibiri, na we ari imbere yazo. Eliya aramwegera amutererako umutamana wiwe ku bitugu, hanyuma arigira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
